								<tr style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
									<td class="content-block" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 20px;" valign="top">
										Join insurance Sales Coach, President and Founder of The Marvis Center Ann M. Cohan on <b>Monday, March 30, 2020 @ 1:00 PM Eastern</b> for a webinar on <b>"Making Working Remotely REALLY Work"</b> hosted by Chandler Hahn. Ann’s coaching has helped countless agents be more successful (she has worked exclusively with the insurance industry since 2008). Her presentation will cover:
<br>
<ul>
<li>How to keep your “game face on” and stay focused</li>
<li>How to keep connected to others in the office so you don’t lose the dynamics of TEAM</li>
<li>How Agents can “inspect what’s expected” without smothering the team members</li>
<li>How to stay motivated and committed day in and day out</li>
<li>How to keep production consistent, and so much more...</li>
</ul>
Ann’s presentation will also feature a team member who she’s been coaching for a number of years who has been successfully working remotely from home as a sales producer since she started with her Agent.
									</td>
